                <mxCell id="notes_body" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left; line-height: 150%;&quot;&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;ICRM / CIA User logs in and sends a natural-language request to the Front End (CIA Chat, HTTPS).&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Upstream MCA / Regulation / CIA data and documents are ingested&amp;nbsp; via&amp;nbsp; HTTP | API (app data), JDBC (batch extracts) and NDM (document files).&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Data / ETL parses feeds, generates vector embeddings and persists a staging snapshot + embeddings to Postgres / pgVector; served to the backend over ODBC.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Agentic Backend (ICRM Director Agent → CIA / Reg-Mgmt / MCA orchestrators &amp;amp; worker agents) runs RAG / vector search on the schema, validates and synthesises the response.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;R2D2 (LLM Proxy) makes token-validated calls to Gemini 2.5 Pro for planning and response synthesis.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Function / Tool Exec issues MCP envelopes to the MCP Servers (CIA / Reg Mgmt / MCA Proxy), which call internal Citi systems over MCP | REST.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;The synthesised answer returns via UI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;The Governance Plane (Entitlements · Audit · Provenance · COIN-Auth) governs every agent action.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Logs / audit trails are written to Logger Storage (ELK).&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=17;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="380" y="1257" width="1160" height="196" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
